    <h1>Accessibility, <em>like the rest.</em></h1>
    <p class="clearwater-lead">A friendly site means friendly to people who use a screen reader, friendly to people who use a keyboard, friendly to people who need accommodation when we visit. WCAG 2.2 AA on the website. Reasonable accommodations on the call.</p>
